Provenance
----------
crsf_cpp is an independent implementation of the CRSF (Crossfire) serial protocol. It was written
from published protocol facts — frame layout, the CRC-8/DVB-S2 polynomial, the LSB-first channel
bit packing, and the length and checksum validity rules.

Betaflight (GPL-3.0) was consulted as a behavioural reference for those facts. No Betaflight source
code was copied, adapted, translated, linked, or redistributed, and no part of this library is a
derivative work of it. Source comments that name Betaflight cite a protocol fact or record where
this implementation deliberately differs; they are citations, not attributions of authorship.

Test vectors are generated by tests/vectors/generate_vectors.py in this repository. None are taken
from another project.

